        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>There's a round electromagnet on the back of this battleglove. You can Install a one-handed melee weapon with light Bulk into the battleglove as if the installed weapon was an upgrade.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Launch Weapon</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (attack)</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have a weapon with which you're trained Installed in the battleglove; <strong>Cost</strong> 5 charges</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Attempt a ranged Strike against a target as if the weapon had the thrown (20 feet) weapon trait. The weapon is no longer Installed. The weapon flies back to the hand with the battleglove after the Strike is complete. If that hand is full when the weapon returns, it falls to the ground in your space.</p>"
